# Custom Modelfile for OpenCode APIs
# Example: Creating a specialized coding assistant from Qwen2.5-Coder

FROM qwen2.5-coder:7b

# Adjust temperature for code generation (0.2 is ideal for exact programming)
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384

# System prompt baked directly into the model weights
SYSTEM """
You are an expert full-stack software engineer and system architect.
When asked for code:
1. Provide production-ready, clean, and bug-free code.
2. Include type definitions, error handling, and comments where appropriate.
3. Keep prose minimal and code front-and-center.
"""
